tem pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.54.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 14th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"Presses down fruits and flowers into jars of fruit and dye. Requires jars to be inputted in one input.\"</big></i>\n</p><p>The Press Machine is used to press either <a href=\"/wiki/Flowers\" title=\"Flowers\">flowers</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Fruits\" title=\"Fruits\">fruits</a> to make dyes or jam respectively. The Press machine requires <a href=\"/wiki/Jar\" title=\"Jar\">jars</a> to function.\n</p><p>Pressing items into jars quadruples its original price.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Each internal storage holds 25 items equating to 6.25 items per section of the display.</li>\n<li>It has 24 different dyes you can make, while it has 11 different jams you can make.\n<ul><li>There are 35 different items you can press using a press machine.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902115538\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 84/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 737/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 106/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019447/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44